    <bpmn:process id="W_W3986" name="W3986. Financial &amp; Tax Due Diligence" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: LOI/exclusivity
Frequency: Per target
Volume: Per target
Owner: CFO / Head of Corporate Development
Participants: Finance (links to VS-17.4), Treasury (links to VS-18), Tax (links to VS-79), Corp Dev, external financial/tax DD advisors, Legal
Source: workflow W3986 — Financial &amp; Tax Due Diligence</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3986_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3986_Lane1" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3986_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3986_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3986_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3986_Lane2" name="Tax">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3986_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3986_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3986_Start4" name="LOI/exclusivity">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3986_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3986_Task5" name="Finance/external-advisors conduct financial DD: quality of earnings (normalized…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Finance/external-advisors conduct financial DD: quality of earnings (normalized EBITDA, one-offs, related-party), working capital (level and seasonality), net debt, off-balance-sheet items, cash conversion, capex/maintenance, and historical/forecast performance — consistent with BuildRight&#x27;s PFRS reporting (links to VS-17.4)
Responsible (R): Finance / external advisors / Corp Dev
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per target</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3986_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3986_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3986_Task6" name="Tax/external-advisors conduct tax DD: direct/indirect tax exposure (VAT, income…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Tax/external-advisors conduct tax DD: direct/indirect tax exposure (VAT, income tax, withholding, local business tax, real property tax links to VS-79), transfer pricing (links to VS-72), tax incentives (BOI/PEZA), historical filings/assessments, and structuring implications
Responsible (R): Tax / external advisors
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per target</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3986_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3986_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3986_Task7" name="Finance/Tax update the deal model, adjust the price/working-capital mechanism…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance/Tax update the deal model, adjust the price/working-capital mechanism (links to W3982), and flag financial/tax risks for SPA protection (links to W3991) and post-close integration (links to PA-130.3)
Responsible (R): Finance / Tax / Corp Dev
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per target</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3986_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3986_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3986_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3986_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3986_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-621 (ensure controlled execution — Transaction Due Diligence, Valuation &amp; Deal Structuring (PA-130.2).) | - operational: quality-of-earnings DD; operational: tax DD and SPA indemnities
Owner: CFO / Head of Corporate Development</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3986_Assoc10" sourceRef="W3986_Annotation9" targetRef="W3986_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3986_Flow11" sourceRef="W3986_Start4" targetRef="W3986_Task5" />
