    <bpmn:process id="W_W3987" name="W3987. Legal, Regulatory &amp; Corporate Due Diligence" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: LOI/exclusivity
Frequency: Per target
Volume: Per target
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Participants: Legal (links to VS-100), Compliance (links to VS-22/VS-119), Tax (links to VS-79), Litigation (links to VS-100.2), external legal counsel, Corp Dev
Source: workflow W3987 — Legal, Regulatory &amp; Corporate Due Diligence</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3987_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3987_Lane1" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3987_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3987_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3987_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3987_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3987_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3987_Start3" name="LOI/exclusivity">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3987_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3987_Task4" name="Legal/external-counsel conduct corporate and legal DD: corporate structure and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Legal/external-counsel conduct corporate and legal DD: corporate structure and authority, ownership/shareholder records, material contracts (customers, vendors, leases links to VS-42, licenses/permits links to VS-22/VS-76), real estate title and encumbrances, IP (links to VS-100), and litigation/matters (links to VS-100.2)
Responsible (R): Legal / External Counsel
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Per target</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3987_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3987_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3987_Task5" name="Legal/Compliance conduct regulatory and compliance DD: licenses/permits across…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Legal/Compliance conduct regulatory and compliance DD: licenses/permits across all locations (links to VS-22/VS-76), BIR/tax compliance, LGU/local-business-tax, data privacy (links to VS-91), competition (links to VS-129), ABC/AML (links to VS-86), labor (links to VS-84), product compliance (links to VS-117/VS-114), and any consent/change-of-control requirements
Responsible (R): Legal / Compliance
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Per target</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3987_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3987_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3987_Task6" name="Legal flag risks for SPA protection (reps/warranties, indemnities, specific…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Legal flag risks for SPA protection (reps/warranties, indemnities, specific indemnity, escrow/retention, walk-right) (links to W3991) and regulatory-clearance planning (links to W3992)
Responsible (R): Legal / Corp Dev
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Per target</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3987_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3987_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3987_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3987_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
