        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-621 (ensure controlled execution — Transaction Due Diligence, Valuation &amp; Deal Structuring (PA-130.2).) | - operational: real-estate DD; operational: DD and consents
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
