    <bpmn:process id="W_W3988" name="W3988. Operational, IT, Systems &amp; Integration Due Diligence" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: LOI/exclusivity
Frequency: Per target
Volume: Per target
Owner: Head of Corporate Development / COO
Participants: Supply Chain (links to VS-02/VS-04/VS-06), Store Ops (links to VS-07), IT (links to VS-27/VS-113), affected business unit, Integration Lead, Corp Dev
Source: workflow W3988 — Operational, IT, Systems &amp; Integration Due Diligence</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3988_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3988_Lane1" name="Supply Chain">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3988_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3988_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3988_Lane2" name="IT">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3988_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3988_Lane3" name="Integration Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3988_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3988_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3988_Start5" name="LOI/exclusivity">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3988_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3988_Task6" name="Supply Chain/Store-Ops conduct operational DD: store network and performance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Supply Chain/Store-Ops conduct operational DD: store network and performance, DC/warehouse footprint and capacity, supply chain and vendor base, inventory and shrink, operating model and staffing, and operational synergy/cost opportunities and risks
Responsible (R): Supply Chain / Store Ops / Corp Dev
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Per target</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3988_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3988_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3988_Task7" name="IT/Integration-Lead conduct IT and systems DD: ERP and application landscape…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: IT/Integration-Lead conduct IT and systems DD: ERP and application landscape (alignment to BuildRight&#x27;s unified ERP and enterprise architecture links to VS-113), data quality/master data (links to VS-29), infrastructure, security (links to VS-27), integration complexity/cost, and the carve-out/separation picture (links to VS-99 ITAM)
Responsible (R): IT / Integration Lead
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: Per target</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3988_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3988_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3988_Task8" name="Integration Lead compile findings and update the integration plan, Day-1 plan…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Integration Lead compile findings and update the integration plan, Day-1 plan (links to W3994), and synergy/cost cases (links to W3993)
Responsible (R): Integration Lead / Corp Dev
Accountable (A): COO / Head of Corp Dev
Duration: Per target</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3988_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3988_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3988_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3988_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
