      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: LOI/exclusivity
Frequency: Per target
Volume: Per target
Owner: CHRO / Head of Corporate Development
Participants: HR (links to VS-19/VS-102/VS-103), Labor Relations (links to VS-84), Legal, Finance (links to VS-17.4 benefits), Corp Dev
Source: workflow W3989 — HR, People &amp; Culture Due Diligence (incl. Labor/Union)</bpmn:documentation>
