Responsible (R): Compliance / Human-Rights DD
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Per target</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3990_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3990_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3990_Task7" name="Sustainability/Legal flag ESG/compliance risks, update the model and SPA (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sustainability/Legal flag ESG/compliance risks, update the model and SPA (links to W3991), and feed integration requirements (links to PA-130.3) and BuildRight&#x27;s ESG reporting (links to VS-25.3)
Responsible (R): Sustainability / Legal / Corp Dev
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Per target</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3990_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3990_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
