    <bpmn:process id="W_W3991" name="W3991. Purchase Agreement (SPA), Negotiation &amp; Signing Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Completion of DD; binding gate (links to W3983)
Frequency: Per transaction
Volume: Per transaction
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance / Head of Corporate Development
Participants: Legal (links to VS-100), external counsel, Corp Dev, Finance/Tax, HR, CEO, sellers/sellers&#x27; counsel
Source: workflow W3991 — Purchase Agreement (SPA), Negotiation &amp; Signing Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3991_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3991_Lane1" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3991_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3991_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3991_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3991_Lane2" name="Corp Dev">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3991_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3991_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3991_Start4" name="Completion of DD; binding gate (links to W3983)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3991_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3991_Task5" name="Legal/external-counsel draft the SPA (asset or share purchase agreement)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Legal/external-counsel draft the SPA (asset or share purchase agreement) reflecting structure (links to W3982): purchase price and mechanism, working-capital adjustment, escrow/retention/earn-out, reps &amp; warranties, indemnities and caps/baskets, specific indemnities for DD findings, conditions precedent (incl. PCC clearance links to W3992), termination rights, and restrictive covenants
Responsible (R): Legal / External Counsel
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Per transaction</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3991_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3991_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3991_Task6" name="Corp Dev/Legal/CEO negotiate the SPA with the sellers, manage open issues and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Corp Dev/Legal/CEO negotiate the SPA with the sellers, manage open issues and price/terms movement, and secure insurance (W&amp;I) where appropriate (links to VS-26)
Responsible (R): Corp Dev / Legal / CEO
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Per transaction</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3991_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3991_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3991_Task7" name="Legal obtain final approvals (links to W3983), manage signing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Legal obtain final approvals (links to W3983), manage signing, conditions-satisfaction, and pre-close obligations, and transition to Day-1/closing (links to W3994)
Responsible (R): Legal / Corp Dev
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Per transaction</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3991_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3991_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3991_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3991_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3991_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-621 (ensure controlled execution — Transaction Due Diligence, Valuation &amp; Deal Structuring (PA-130.2).) | - operational: specific indemnities and W&amp;I; operational: walk-away discipline and stage-gate
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance / Head of Corporate Development</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3991_Assoc10" sourceRef="W3991_Annotation9" targetRef="W3991_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3991_Flow11" sourceRef="W3991_Start4" targetRef="W3991_Task5" />
