      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Signing; notifiable transaction (links to W3967)
Frequency: Per notifiable transaction
Volume: Per notifiable transaction
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Participants: Legal (links to VS-100/VS-129), external competition counsel, Corp Dev, Govt Affairs (links to VS-104), affected business unit, SEC/corporate secretariat (links to VS-36.1)
Source: workflow W3992 — Regulatory Clearance, PCC Merger Notification &amp; Antitrust Approval</bpmn:documentation>
